  {
    "description": "Search document files and content. Without a pattern, lists files with size/type info. With a pattern, searches text/PDF/Excel content (best-effort) and returns matching lines in ripgrep format. Large or unsupported binaries fall back to path-only matching with a note.",
    "name": "doc_search",
