          "type": "string",
        },
      },
      "type": "object",
    },
  },
  {
    "description": "Create or overwrite a document file. If the file exists, updates its content. If new, creates it (with parent folders by default). Only supports text-based files; PDF/Excel are not supported for writing. After using this tool, assistant messages should mention only the created or updated file path, not the file content.",
