  {
    "description": "Edit a HyperFrames project file (the composition index.html by default, or frame.md / design.md) by replacing old_string with new_string. Prefer this over hyperframes_write when changing a small portion of a large composition. By default only the first occurrence is replaced; set replace_all to true to replace every occurrence. Fails if old_string is not found. Returns the validation report for the edited composition.",
